namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 제출대상 : 학위논문심사 결과 “합격자”</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [2013. 12. 24(화) 논문심사 결과 발표]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 제출기한 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 12. 31(화)까지</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 제출서류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 가. 표지 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 속표지 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 다. 인준서 1부(심사위원 인준도장 날인 생략).</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 라. 목차 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 마. 요약 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">* 국문논문은 영문요약(초록) 수록분이 포함되어 있어야 하며,</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;외국어논문은 국문요약(320자이내) 수록분이 포함되어 있어야 함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">※ 학위논문관련양식은 본교 대학원별 홈페이지-논문안내에서 확인가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 제출방법 : 메일제출</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><a href=\"mailto:theseuswin@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">theseuswin@kumoh.ac.kr</span></u></a><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></u> </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;- 위의 제출서류 파일명은 학번성명.hwp파일(ex: 20114123홍길동.hwp)로 제출</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;- 마이크로소프트 워드파일(*.doc파일) 제출불가(본교 학위논문작성법양식은 hwp파일이므로 doc파일은 불가능합니다.)</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움\">※ 메일 제출 후 대학원 검증 완료 후 도서관 홈페이지 dcollection 프로그램에</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">원문파일 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 12.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\